    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "build_steps",
      "x": 320,
      "y": 228,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 145,
      "text": "1. Poll API: QUEUED jobs\n2. Claim: QUEUED → CLONING\n3. Clone repo via SSH\n4. Check NCS version\n5. Copy signing keys\n6. Run build.sh (cmake)\n7. Collect .hex + .elf\n8. Compute SHA-256\n9. Upload to MinIO\n10. Status → SUCCESS",
      "originalText": "1. Poll API: QUEUED jobs\n2. Claim: QUEUED → CLONING\n3. Clone repo via SSH\n4. Check NCS version\n5. Copy signing keys\n6. Run build.sh (cmake)\n7. Collect .hex + .elf\n8. Compute SHA-256\n9. Upload to MinIO\n10. Status → SUCCESS",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#dbeafe",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
