      "text": "1. PipelineRun created\n2. ValidationQueueEntry\n   per MTIB node\n3. Create API key\n   (ck_run_*, 24h expiry)\n4. Create K8s Job\n   env: CONCORD_RUN_ID,\n        API_KEY, API_URL\n5. Init container:\n   wait-for-db",
