      "id": "exec_detail",
      "x": 1185,
      "y": 228,
      "width": 270,
      "height": 145,
      "text": "Session → Device → TestExecution\n  → TestStep (per assertion)\n\nReporter plugin (fire-and-forget):\n  POST /report/start\n  POST /report/test-start\n  POST /report/test-result\n  POST /report/finish\n\nSocket.IO: validation_test_result\nStatus: PASSED / FAILED / SKIPPED",
      "originalText": "Session → Device → TestExecution\n  → TestStep (per assertion)\n\nReporter plugin (fire-and-forget):\n  POST /report/start\n  POST /report/test-start\n  POST /report/test-result\n  POST /report/finish\n\nSocket.IO: validation_test_result\nStatus: PASSED / FAILED / SKIPPED",
